	"//": "@workbench/flow + @xyflow/svelte back exactly ONE subpath, ./hierarchy — the project›warehouse›namespace›table view two zones render (home's /projects/<id> and the lakehouse Overview) and neither may import from the other. The vendor CANVAS binding still lives in @workbench/flow, not here; what @workbench/ui owns is the domain view drawn on it, transport-agnostic on the GrantsPanel precedent. A zone importing @workbench/ui/hierarchy must declare both packages itself and import their two stylesheets layer(base) in its app.css — no other subpath pulls them."
